<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 90,695 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 90,695 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 90,695 bags in the week ending Nov 24 versus 123,706 bags in the corresponding week to Nov 26, 1995, Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,181,871 bags against 1,567,089 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
